---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import TerminalType from '../components/TerminalType.astro';
import { SITE, SERVICES, CONTACT } from '../site.config';
---

<BaseLayout>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero__grid">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">IT · Security · Compliance · Platform Operations</p>
          <h1>
            Technology, made <span class="italic-green">calmer</span> for small
            business.
          </h1>
          <p class="lead">
            {SITE.description.split('. ')[0]}. 20+ years across healthcare,
            banking, MSP, and enterprise environments — turned into plain-English
            guidance for the businesses that keep local communities running.
          </p>
          <TerminalType
            line="$ tail -f /var/log/business --follow --lines=all  # no panic, just process"
          />
          <div class="hero__actions">
            <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/contact">book a free 30-min call</a>
            <a class="btn" href="/services">see services</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="term" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="term__bar">
            <div class="term__dots">
              <span class="term__dot term__dot--red"></span>
              <span class="term__dot term__dot--yellow"></span>
              <span class="term__dot term__dot--green"></span>
            </div>
            <span class="term__title">~/compliance/quick-check.sh</span>
          </div>
          <div class="term__body">
            <pre><code><span class="prompt">$</span> ./quick-check.sh --business=small
[OK]   Know which rules apply to you ....... YES
[OK]   Access controls in place ........... YES
[OK]   Data encrypted (at rest + transit) . YES
[OK]   Staff trained on the basics ........ YES
[OK]   Incident plan written down ......... PARTIAL
[!!]   Evidence documented for auditors .. NO

<span class="prompt">$</span> echo "You are not alone in this."
You are not alone in this.

<span class="prompt">$</span> ./start-conversation.sh
<span class="cursor"></span></code></pre>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section container">
    <h2>Where I help</h2>
    <p class="lead">
      Most small businesses only need <strong>one or two</strong> frameworks —
      and they usually don't know which. That's where I come in.
    </p>
    <div class="grid grid--2" style="margin-top: var(--sp-8)">
      {SERVICES.map((s) => (
        <a href={s.path} class="card card--accent" style="color: inherit">
          <div class="card__meta">service // {s.slug}</div>
          <div class="card__title">{s.title}</div>
          <p style="margin-bottom: 0">{s.summary}</p>
          <p class="card__more" style="margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: var(--sp-4)">
            <span class="prompt">$</span> read more →
          </p>
        </a>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section container">
    <h2>The fear, removed</h2>
    <div class="grid grid--2">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card__title">"Is my business even subject to this?"</div>
        <p>
          HIPAA, PCI DSS, SOC 2 — the acronyms pile up fast. Most businesses are
          subject to at least one rule without realizing it. I'll tell you exactly
          which frameworks apply to you, and which ones you can safely ignore.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card__title">"This feels like a full-time job."</div>
        <p>
          It doesn't have to be. Reasonable protection for the information you
          already handle — not a 200-page compliance program. Simple policies,
          quarterly training, and a partner who speaks plain English.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card__title">"What about AI? Everyone wants us to use it."</div>
        <p>
          AI is an opportunity — and a risk. The #1 small-business risk today is
          unstructured AI adoption (shadow AI). I help you adopt AI tools safely:
          clear policies, approved tool lists, and human review built in.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card__title">"I can't afford a Big 4 firm."</div>
        <p>
          You shouldn't have to. Direct access to one experienced professional —
          founder to founder — at a fraction of the cost of a firm or a full-time
          CISO.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section container">
    <div class="term">
      <div class="term__bar">
        <div class="term__dots">
          <span class="term__dot term__dot--red"></span>
          <span class="term__dot term__dot--yellow"></span>
          <span class="term__dot term__dot--green"></span>
        </div>
        <span class="term__title">~/credentials</span>
      </div>
      <div class="term__body">
        <pre><code><span class="prompt">$</span> cat credentials.txt

20+ years  IT operations & support
2          SOC 2 compliance projects (Type I & Type II)
3          Regulated industries: healthcare · banking · MSP
2          Public recommendations: patience & clarity under pressure
1          "Heart of Hospice" award (2016)

<span class="prompt">$</span> whoami
Ahron Darnell — making technology calmer, clearer, and more reliable.</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section container">
    <div class="card">
      <h2 style="margin-top: 0">Not sure where to start?</h2>
      <p class="lead">
        Book a free 30-minute call. No jargon, no pressure — just a straight
        answer about which compliance and security steps actually matter for
        your business.
      </p>
      <div class="hero__actions">
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/contact">start the conversation</a>
        <a class="btn" href={CONTACT.linkedin} rel="me noopener" target="_blank">connect on linkedin</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
